<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- West Virginia Hospital Authority.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- West Virginia Hospital Authority.</headline>
<text>
<p>WEST VIRGINIA HOSPITAL FINANCE AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $21,710,000</p>
<p>HOSPITAL REFUNDING REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1997</p>
<p>(DEPARTMENT OF HEALTH AND HUMAN RESOURCES PROJECT)</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed and the bonds are free to trade.</p>
<p>Ferris, Baker Watts Inc.</p>
<p>Crews &amp; Associates, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
